WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Front balance shaft
What it does: Its eccentric mass generates a force that combines with the other shaft to reduce secondary vibration.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Front balance shaft
How it works: The pair produces a coordinated periodic force.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Front balance shaft
How it moves: Rotates at twice crankshaft speed and in the opposite direction to the other balance shaft.
